# Embedded libraries — UPSTREAM MIRRORS, not tracked (avoids churn obscuring
# the fork diff; the packager re-fetches them from .pkgmeta externals).
#
# FORK-OWNED LIBS POLICY
# ----------------------
# A few libs are BT4-specific (Nevcairiel / Bartender-ecosystem authorship,
# tight coupling) and are legitimate targets for fork modification. When a
# BT4-specific lib is first modified it becomes *fork-owned source*, not an
# upstream mirror. Onboarding procedure (all FOUR steps, together):
#   1. Remove its line from this .gitignore (so the modified source is tracked).
#   2. git add + commit the lib directory.
#   3. Remove its .pkgmeta external (git becomes the source of truth; a
#      packaged build then carries the patched copy, not upstream stock).
#   4. Move its load line in the .toc OUTSIDE the #@no-lib-strip@ block (the
#      no-lib packaged build strips everything inside those markers; a
#      fork-owned lib must ship+load in BOTH builds). Place it with the other
#      always-load tracked bundles (SimpleSticky / LibDataBroker), after its
#      dependencies' load lines.
# Safe-state rule: a lib is EITHER {ignored + .pkgmeta external present} OR
# {tracked + external removed}. The mixed states are bugs — ignored+no-external
# ships a broken release; tracked+external lets the packager overwrite the
# patch. Un-ignoring and de-externaling MUST move together.
# BT4-specific (fork-ownable when modified): LibActionButton-1.0 [DONE — see
# below], LibButtonGlow-1.0, LibKeyBound-1.0. (SimpleSticky.lua,
# LibDataBroker-1.1.lua are already tracked single-file BT4 bundles.)
# Everything else below is a generic ecosystem mirror — keep ignored.
# See Bartender4-fufu.md "Fork-owned libraries" and CLAUDE.md rule #5.

libs/AceAddon-3.0/
libs/AceConfig-3.0/
libs/AceConsole-3.0/
libs/AceDB-3.0/
libs/AceDBOptions-3.0/
libs/AceEvent-3.0/
libs/AceGUI-3.0/
libs/AceGUI-3.0-SharedMediaWidgets/
libs/AceHook-3.0/
libs/AceLocale-3.0/
libs/CallbackHandler-1.0/
# libs/LibActionButton-1.0/  <- FORK-OWNED (perf-patched, tracked). Do NOT
#   re-add this line, and keep its .pkgmeta external removed (see policy above).
libs/LibButtonGlow-1.0/
libs/LibClassicSpellActionCount-1.0/
libs/LibDBIcon-1.0/
libs/LibDeflate/
